    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kinyasunae Yerusalem nabo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋikaru a Sedekia ŋatomoniarei ka epei apaki ŋina esyakinia iŋes akipuka Yudaya. Kipuka iŋes Yudaya alo Yerusalem ŋikaru ŋitomon ka epei. Arae ekiro a toto keŋ Amutal nakoku a Yeremia a ŋolo alo Libina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Sedekia kitiya ŋakiro ŋuna aronok alokiŋaren Ekapolon, lopite jik ŋolo etiyator Yeoiakim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kire, apotu ŋituŋa a Yerusalem ka ŋituŋa a akwap a Yudaya kitoŋoa nooi Ekapolon, aŋun abu Ekapolon kirita ikes alokiŋaren keŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Sedekia toŋer akiwuap ŋakiro ŋuna ke erwosit a Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodi alokaru a ŋolo a ŋikanikaomwon, elap ŋolo a ŋitomon, ŋirwa ke elap ŋitomon ipukat Sedekia, abu erwosit a Babilon ŋolo anyaritae Nebukadinesar toloto ka ŋasigarya keŋ daadaŋ akirem Yerusalem kirikaut iŋes. Apotu ikes torekinos kiŋa etaun, toduko ŋadoketa kisiryama kiŋa etaun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ikes torubakis irikaunito etaun akitodol lokaru ŋolo a ŋitomon ka epei ipukat erwosit Sedekia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edoli ŋirwa ke elap ŋikanikaomwon, elap ŋolo a ŋiomwon, tonyam akoro ŋituŋa nooi alotaun, todaun anakwap ibore ŋini imujete ŋituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi topedoi arwatata ŋina ke etaun, ido apotu ŋasigarya daadaŋ toema nakwaare alotaun, kitoro ikes lopuke ŋolo apedokinitoe kidiŋ ŋarwatatain ŋuna edunyasi ka emanikor ŋolo ke erwosit, tari daŋ ŋina erikaunitotor Ŋibabiloniyae etaun. Apotu ikes toema lowae ŋolo ka Araba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai apotu ŋasigarya a Ŋibabiloniyae kiwuapa erwosit Sedekia, ido toditasi anadipoe a Yeriko, apotu ŋasigarya a Sedekia daadaŋ toema kielaros aneni keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋasigarya a Ŋibabiloniyae kikamut erwosit Sedekia, yaasi neni a erwosit a Babilon alo Ribila anakwap a ŋina ka Amas, neni abunio iŋes totubokinia Sedekia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu erwosit a Babilon toar ŋidwe a Sedekia ŋulusapa ite Sedekia ka abu daŋ toar ŋikapolok a Yudaya daadaŋ alo Ribila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu daŋ togorono ŋakonyen a Sedekia, toeniu iŋes a ŋiriko, yaarae Babilon neni aponere toenere Sedekia akitodol akoloŋit ŋina atwania.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edoli ŋirwa ke elap ŋitomon, elap ŋolo a ŋikan, torae ekaru ŋolo a ŋitomon ka ŋikanikaomwon ipukat erwosit Nebukadinesar ŋolo a Babilon, toloma Nebusaradan ekapolokiniton a ŋasigarya a ŋuna eyokiyete erwosit a Babilon Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kicunyak Nebusaradan Akai ka Akuj ka akai a erwosit ta ŋakais daadaŋ ŋuna aya Yerusalem. Kicunyak iŋes ŋakais daadaŋ ŋuna a ŋikapolok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋasigarya a Ŋibabiloniyae daadaŋ ŋuna arukito kaapei ka ekapolokiniton a ŋasigarya a ŋuna eyokiyete erwosit kituwosi ŋarwatatain a Yerusalem daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Nebusaradan, ekapolokiniton a ŋasigarya a ŋuna eyokiyete erwosit a Babilon toriko ŋituŋa ŋice ŋulu akulyakakaka akilo ŋuluce ka ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu edoŋito lotaun ta ŋulu kepotu tocamut akirii ka erwosit a Babilon kaapei ka ŋituŋa ŋulu ayenete akitiyaunun ŋiboro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu iŋes kimyek ŋituŋa ŋice ŋulu akulyakakaka nooi anakwap a ŋin aŋuna ka akitub ŋikito ŋulu ke epiini ka akitare ŋimanikorin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Ŋibabiloniyae tobwaŋabwaŋata ŋipirin ŋulu ke eburonis ŋulu alotooma Akai ka Akuj toukosi daŋ ŋawoeta ŋuna a etorube a anam ŋolo ayai Kai ka Akuj ŋolo etiyaunitae a eburonis, ido yaasi eburonis daadaŋ Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu daŋ Ŋibabiloniyae yaasi ŋamoti, ŋakitiyoi, ŋileŋia ŋulu etubere ŋausi a ŋitaae, ŋakijikoi ŋuna apolok ka ŋiboro daadaŋ ŋulu etiyaunitae a eburonis, ŋulu esitiyaeneneo alo Kai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ekapolokiniton a ŋasigarya a ŋuna eyokiyete erwosit a Babilon ya ŋabakulei ŋuna cicik daŋ, kaapei ka ŋasipiryae, ŋabapwa, ŋawoeta a ŋitaae, ŋakijikoi ŋuna apolok ka ŋabakulei ŋuna awuatanakinere ŋituŋa ŋakipi, ŋiboro daadaŋ ŋulu etiyaunitae a egolid ka a esilipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eruwor ŋipirin ŋuluarei, etorube a anam, ŋitorubei a ŋimoŋin ŋulutomon ka ŋiarei ŋulu etiyaunitae a eburonis ŋulu aya kwap etorube a anam ka ŋawoeta, ŋiboro ŋulu abu Solomon kitiyau aŋuna ka Akai ka Akuj, pa apedoritae akipimun apotis a eburonis a ŋolo etiyaunitere ŋiboro ŋul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae aoyau a ŋolopir ŋimitae ŋikanikauni ameun alokwap tari kidiama, torae aburis keŋ ŋimitae ŋulu aapiyarito ŋikan, aorori epir alotooma, ido arae aburis a asuwat a ŋina etiyaunitere iŋes ŋimitae ŋatomonikanikaarei ka ŋikan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayai daŋ akou a epir a ŋol, arae aoyau a akou a epir a ŋol ŋimitae ŋiarei ka esibusitae a ŋitorubei a ŋaraito a ŋuna ikote ŋaraito a ekacikicikit a ŋuna enyaritae pomegranate. Etiyaunitae ŋitorubei a ŋaraito ŋul a eburonis ka eluluŋ. Ŋolocepir daŋ ekoni neni pei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakasi nawaetin a ŋipirin ŋitorubei ŋulu a ŋaraito a ŋuna ikote ŋaraito a ekacikicikit, arae ŋitorubei a ŋaraito ŋul daadaŋ ŋulu esibusitere ŋakyes a ŋipirin a ŋul, ido arae amiat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ekapolokiniton a ŋasigarya a ŋuna eyokiyete erwosit a Babilon kikama Seraia esacaradoti ŋolo apolon nooi, Sepania esacaradoti ŋolo atupit Seraia anapolou ka ŋiketeok ŋiuni ŋulu eteete ŋikekya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tosodi alotaun, abu iŋes toriko ekile ŋolo arae ekarikiton a ŋasigarya ka ŋikilyok ŋikanikaarei ŋulu eŋarakinito erwosit akipuka ŋulu aryamunio alotaun ta ekegirigiran a ekapolokiniton a ŋasigarya ŋolo apolokinit ŋasigarya daadaŋ anakwap keŋ kaapei ka ŋikilyok ŋatomonikanikapei ŋulu aryamunio alotaun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Nebusaradan, ekapolokiniton a ŋasigarya a ŋuna eyokiyete erwosit a Babilon ya ikes Ribila neni a erwosit a Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu erwosit a Babilon toar ikes alo Ribila alotaun a ŋolo ayai nakwap ŋina enyaritae Amas. Ekoni nen arikoro a ŋituŋa a Yudaya anakwap kec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae lo ekimar a ŋituŋa a ŋulu abu Nebukadinesar toriko nakwap keŋ erae ŋimabus: Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋikanikaarei aponi torikoroe Ŋiyudayan ŋalipyo ŋauni ka ŋatomoniarei ka ŋiuni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alokaru a ŋolo a ŋitomon ka ŋikanikauni ipukat Nebukanidesar, abu iŋes toriko alo Yerusalem ŋituŋa ŋalipyo ŋakanikauni ka ŋatomoniuni ka ŋiarei, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alokaru a ŋolo a ŋatomoniarei ka ŋiuni ipukat Nebukadinesar, abu Nabusaradan ekapolokiniton a ŋasigarya a ŋuna eyokiyete erwosit a Babilon toriko Ŋiyudayan ŋalipyo ŋakanikaarei ka ŋatomoniomwon ka ŋikan, arae ekimar a ŋituŋa a daadaŋ a ŋulu aponi torikoroe ŋalipyo ŋakanikapei ka ŋamiae ŋaomwon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tominakinae Yeoiakim anakwap a ŋina arikoritae",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋatomoniuni ka ŋikanikaarei, ŋirwa ke elap ŋatomoniarei ka ŋikan elap ŋolo a ŋitomon ka ŋiarei, eriŋa Yeoiakin erwosit a Yudaya erae emabus alo Babilon, kisyak Ebilimerodak ŋolo alo Babilon akipuka Babilon, tolacak Ebilimerodak Yeoiakim erwosit a Yudaya alomabus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu iŋes torimaaniar aneni a Yeoiakin kitopoloo iŋes adepar ŋirwosi ŋuluce ŋulu epukatotor iŋes alo Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun abu Yeoiakin tolaca tari ŋilowi keŋ ŋulu sek alomabus ka abu toruwor ŋolo emujenene alokai ke erwosit jwi jwi anakiyar keŋ a daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu erwosit a Babilon inanak Yeoiakim ŋisiliŋa ŋidi a ŋinakoloŋit, ikotere iŋarakinor ŋirwa daadaŋ ŋulu eboiyo iŋes alo Babilon akitodol akoloŋit ŋina atwania iŋes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
